- Foyer void and stair: floor-2 layer absent at x20..25, y5, z9..13; stair/bullnose cells x20..24, y2..5, z9..13 (P6); banister (23,3..6,10..13), gallery rail (23..25,6,14), chandelier (22..24,5..8,10..12) (P6).
